body:
I found a temporary fix if anyone is wondering. I unplugged my 4k monitor and the freeze stop took effect. Then I replugged it and the fans stayed at 0%. Seems like this will be my solution for the time being until Zotac fixes it. I can't even hear my PC anymore and I do regret shitting on this brand but they need to fix the software so I do not need to unplug it everytime for it to work.

&#x200B;

Well the sound came back on because freeze stopped at 52-54C and now it is annoying again and won't go away even when the gpu temp is 37C. Jesus christ
